        "description": "What SYMBOLISES this object, for surfaces too small to read it: the minimap, a row in the document browser, the tab favicon. NOT drawn on a canvas — a node at full size already shows its own content — so a badge written to say what a box IS or how it is DOING is invisible to anyone reading the board. To record state or kind on a board, write a scoped tag instead (\`priority:high\`) AND declare its key in the workspace tag library: a declared value carries a colour, so the boxes wearing it are drawn in it and the board legend names it. A tag nobody declared is recorded and drawn in nothing.",
